function dayOfWeekOptimal(day, month, year):
    // Adjust month and year for January and February
    if (month <= 2):
        month = month + 12
        year = year - 1
    q = day
    m = month
    k = year % 100     // Year within century
    j = floor(year / 100)  // Zero-based century
    h = (q + floor(13*(m+1)/5) + k + floor(k/4) + floor(j/4) + 5*j) mod 7
    // Mapping: 0 = Saturday, 1 = Sunday, 2 = Monday, ..., 6 = Friday
    return h
Time Complexity: O(1) – A fixed number of mathematical operations.
Space Complexity: O(1)
